  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div><ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Vì <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình bình hành nên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>⇒</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>80</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Theo định lí côsin, ta có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Ta có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>12</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>25</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>80</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>664</mn></mrow></semantics></math>,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>8</mn></semantics></math>.\n\t\t\t\tSuy ra, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow></semantics></math>,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>8</mn></semantics></math>.</li><li>Vì tam giác <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>C</mi></semantics></math> nên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>G</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>G</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>680</mn></mrow></semantics></math>,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>9</mn></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\t\tSuy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>26</mn></mrow></semantics></math>,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>1</mn></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\t\tVậy độ lớn hợp lực của ba lực là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>26</mn></semantics></math>,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>1</mn></semantics></math> N.</li></ol></div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/b725faa23a58b033c5f516ce792737c1a8e5eb93b3c75ee866d4a9a716dac130.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
